Force the VM-side QubesDB daemon to stay in the foreground in non-systemd
builds so the Shepherd can track the process it starts.  Without this the
daemon double-forks and leaves duplicate daemons racing for the same vchan.

Guix-specific: the Shepherd needs a foreground process.  A more general,
upstreamable form would add a proper --foreground flag to db-daemon;
this minimal edit only flips the no-systemd daemonize branch so the
behavior matches what this channel previously did via substitute*.
Upstream file: QubesOS/qubes-core-qubesdb, daemon/db-daemon.c.

